<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Sulzer.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Sulzer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Sulzer AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,000 CHF		 PREMIUM	8.71 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.45 CHF		  GEARING	18 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.FEB.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	19.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  970 CHF --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
